OL,3,GNEWSACan blue poo reveal how smart you
OL,4,Aare?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat can our digestion tell us about
OL,7,Fhow our brains work?
OL,9,FExperts at the University of
OL,10,FSouthampton say we still don't
OL,11,Funderstand enough about this important
OL,12,Fconnection.
OL,14,FA research team is asking thousands of
OL,15,Fpeople to take what's called the Blue
OL,16,FPoo Test.
OL,18,FIt involves tracking the speed muffins
OL,19,Fbaked with edible food colouring are
OL,20,Fdigested and then taking part in online
OL,21,Fbrain games.
